# Booking form delivery (Formspree)
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io
# 2. Add a new form; set the notification email to where you want enquiries to land
#    (e.g. booking@aaaevents.com)
# 3. Formspree gives you an endpoint like https://formspree.io/f/xnqkergb
#    Copy ONLY the ID at the end (xnqkergb) and paste it below.
# 4. Copy this file to ".env.local" and rebuild (npm run build), or set the same
#    variable in your Vercel project settings (Settings -> Environment Variables).
#
# Until this is set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email client.

NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
